@LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:9000

# ---------- Giltiga ansökningar → 201 Created ----------

### Anna, 100 000 kr → 201
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-2010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Erik, 5 000 kr → 201
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19851224-1234",
  "amount": 5000
}

### Sara, 2 500 000 kr → 201
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "20000229-9876",
  "amount": 2500000
}

### Ali, 1 kr (minsta giltiga) → 201
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19751010-5555",
  "amount": 1
}

# ---------- Ogiltiga ansökningar → 400 Bad Request ----------

### Saknar bindestreck → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "199001012010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Kort format (YYMMDD) → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "900101-2010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### För få slutsiffror → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-201",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Bokstäver → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "1990010A-2010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Plustecken i stället för bindestreck → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101+2010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Tomt personnummer → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Personnummer saknas (null) → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": null,
  "amount": 100000
}

### Belopp 0 → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-2010",
  "amount": 0
}

### Negativt belopp → 400
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-2010",
  "amount": -5000
}

###
